    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 03 VISUAL GUIDE</div>\n    <h4>The workspace: a filesystem container and its durability primitive</h4>\n    <p>The town is discovered by walking up; config is a four-layer stack; the Hook survives restarts</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">THE TOWN IS DISCOVERED, NOT CONFIGURED — walk UP for mayor/town.json</text>\n      <g transform=\"translate(40, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">TOWN</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">~/gt/ — the management HQ</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">TownConfig = identity only</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">owner email · public name</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(256, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">RIG</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a managed repository</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Polecats · Crew · Witness</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">the org chart is a DIR TREE</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(472, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE CONFIG STACK</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">system → town → bead → wisp</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a returned SOURCE per value</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">a local VETO (SourceBlocked)</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(688, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE LEDGER</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">durable issues</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">+ ephemeral WISPS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">merged EXPLICITLY</text>\n      </g>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#059669\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#047857\">THE HOOK IS THE DURABILITY PRIMITIVE</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">\"work on your hook survives session restarts,</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\"> context compaction, and handoffs\" (hook.go:33)</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">The SESSION is ephemeral; the POINTER is not.</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#047857\">gt sling (keep context) vs gt handoff (fresh context).</text>\n      <rect x=\"470\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">ZFC — ZERO FRAMEWORK COGNITION</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">\"Gas Town provides TRANSPORT (tmux, hooks, nudges)</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">but doesn't make decisions for agents.\"</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">52 in-code references · a changelog of removals</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">The clearest stated-and-enforced philosophy in the study.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
