    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 04 VISUAL GUIDE</div>\n    <h4>Automations: workflows as data, and a watchdog chain with a base case</h4>\n    <p>47 tested formulas, a real mail bus, and the answer to who watches the watchers</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-04\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">1 · THE FORMULAS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">47 .formula.toml embedded</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">convoy · workflow · expansion · aspect</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">Pour → durable sub-wisps</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">the PROSE IS TESTED</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 220 95 L 258 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-04)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(262, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">2 · THE MAIL BUS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">beads-backed</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">lists · queues · announce</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">queue OR interrupt delivery</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">3s idle-or-queue fallback</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 462 95 L 500 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-04)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(504, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">3 · THE REFINERY</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">batch-then-bisect</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">batch 5 · wait 30s</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">retry before bisecting</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">safety stop = a bead LABEL</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 704 95 L 742 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-04)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(746, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"154\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">4 · RECOVERY</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">re-dispatch capped at 3</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">5m cooldown</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">then escalate to Mayor</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">the reaper decides NOTHING</text>\n      </g>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"880\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">THE WATCHDOG CHAIN — AND ITS NAMED BASE CASE</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"248\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">daemon → Boot (a dog, fresh each tick, wakes the Deacon via gt nudge) → Deacon (heartbeat = a FILE, 5m/20m thresholds)</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"268\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">→ Witness → Polecat — each level decides whether the level below is alive.</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"294\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">THE RECURSION, ANSWERED: Witnesses read the Deacon's agent-bead last_activity TIMESTAMP and escalate only if stale —</text>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">\"instead of sending heartbeat mail\" (mol-deacon-patrol). The patrol formula is a design document.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
