    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 06 VISUAL GUIDE</div>\n    <h4>Out-of-pole: a three-layer sandbox, a rotator, and plugins with no AI</h4>\n    <p>The machinery that makes this a product rather than a harness</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-06\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g transform=\"translate(20, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">1 · NETWORK</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">an mTLS CA</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a certificate DENYLIST</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">checked in the TLS handshake</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">rotated on a TTL</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 230 95 L 268 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-06)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(272, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"210\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">2 · THE CLI SURFACE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">AllowedSubcommands</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">gt · bd only</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">absent argv[1] → 403</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">a subprocess allow-list</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 482 95 L 520 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-06)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(524, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">3 · VCS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a git smart-HTTP proxy</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">containers never contact</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">GitHub directly</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">all traffic flows through</text>\n      </g>\n      <path d=\"M 724 95 L 762 95\" stroke=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-06)\"/>\n      <g transform=\"translate(766, 20)\">\n        <rect width=\"134\" height=\"150\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"var(--border-color, #e2e8f0)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">THE ROTATOR</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">swaps the KEYCHAIN</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">backup → swap</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">respawn → --resume</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"95\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">work survives it</text>\n      </g>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">DOCTOR — 75 FIXABLE CHECKS</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">20,485 lines across 75 non-test check files</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a check is FixableCheck — it REPAIRS, not reports</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">each header cites the ticket that explains it</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">Repair is a first-class capability.</text>\n      <rect x=\"470\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#059669\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#047857\">PLUGINS — 13 SHELL SCRIPTS</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">plugin.md (TOML) + run.sh — 2,069 lines</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">a GATE · bead-label TRACKING · EXECUTION metadata</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">scoped town-level or rig-level</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#047857\">\"Executed via run.sh — NO AI INTERPRETATION.\"</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
